# CODEOWNERS — automatic review requests for the Hospital Management System
#
# When a PR touches a path below, GitHub auto-requests review from the listed
# owners. Combined with a branch-protection rule that requires CODEOWNERS review,
# this guarantees the right people see changes to sensitive areas.
#
# Order matters: the LAST matching pattern wins.
#
# TODO(governance): replace the placeholder teams/handles below with your real
# GitHub org teams (create them under github.com/orgs/axonxmedtech/teams) or
# individual @handles. Until these exist, GitHub silently skips the request.

# ── Default: everything is owned by the core maintainers ──────────────────────
*                               @axonxmedtech/maintainers

# ── Backend (Spring Boot) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/backend/                       @axonxmedtech/backend-team

# ── Frontend (React) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/frontend/                      @axonxmedtech/frontend-team

# ── Security-sensitive: auth, tenant isolation, JWT ───────────────────────────
# These paths gate multi-tenant patient-data isolation. Require a security review.
/backend/src/main/java/com/hms/security/     @axonxmedtech/security-team
/backend/src/main/java/com/hms/config/       @axonxmedtech/security-team

# ── Database schema & migrations ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Schema changes on healthcare data are high-risk — require a DBA/lead review.
/backend/src/main/resources/db/              @axonxmedtech/backend-leads
/setup/                                       @axonxmedtech/backend-leads

# ── CI/CD, deployment, and repository governance ──────────────────────────────
/.github/                       @axonxmedtech/platform-team
/backend/Dockerfile             @axonxmedtech/platform-team

# ── Documentation ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/docs/                          @axonxmedtech/maintainers
*.md                            @axonxmedtech/maintainers
